==============================================================================
S7  K_5 and K_{3,3} in the underlying graph
==============================================================================
Underlying simple graph of M (any orientation, all cross pairs linked): complete graph K_{m+n} on V_A u V_B, plus alpha ~ V_A and beta ~ V_B.
  m=1 n=1 : V=4 E=3 3V-6=6 Euler-violated=False K_{3,3}-subgraph=False K_5-subgraph=False
